# An Ideological Analysis of Digital Reference Service Models.

**Authors:** Dilevko, Juris

## Abstract
Looks at some of the new paradigms for reference service, in particular the ideological implications of the digital reference call-center model, demonstrates how they lead to a &quot;deprofessionalization&quot; of reference work, and provides examples of how extensive reading can help reference librarians provide better service and become an irreplaceable contributor in the reference transaction. (Contains 51 references.) (AEF)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ643487

